  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAO IC - Technical Assistance for TERRA Guarantee</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The EU contribution of up to EUR 4,585,714 is the Technical Assistance component (hereinafter the &#xbf;&lt;strong&gt;Action&lt;/strong&gt;&#xbf;) of the &lt;strong&gt;&#xbf;Transforming and Empowering Resilient and Responsible Agribusiness (TERRA)&#xbf; Proposed Investment Programme (PIP). &lt;/strong&gt;The &#xbf;TERRA Programme&#xbf; (hereinafter the &#xbf;&lt;strong&gt;Programme&lt;/strong&gt;&#xbf;) comprises of (i) a Technical Assistance component and (ii) a Guarantee component; and was given a positive opinion by the EFSD+ Operational Board in December 2022. The Programme is being implemented by Cassa Depositi e Prestiti (CDP) as lead institution for the financial component, and the Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO) - (hereinafter the &#xbf;&lt;strong&gt;Organisation&lt;/strong&gt;&#xbf;) &#xbf; as lead institution for the Technical Assistance (TA) component.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The Programme seeks to develop sustainable agri-food systems via integrated capacity building and access to innovative finance through two interlinked components: TA and Guarantees. The Programme is targeted for implementation over the period 2024-2029, with activities under the TA component (hereinafter the &#xbf;&lt;strong&gt;Action&lt;/strong&gt;&#xbf;) scheduled to commence following the signature of the Guarantee Agreement.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
